1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,720
You pay four seventy-five for a coffee.

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,690
The coffee shop doesn't get

3
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:05,804
four seventy-five.

4
00:00:06,554 --> 00:00:08,858
The biggest slice goes to your bank.

5
00:00:09,158 --> 00:00:11,030
The network takes one.

6
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,610
The shop's card company takes one.

7
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:16,090
Ten or fifteen cents a coffee.

8
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:18,862
So who pays for it?

9
00:00:19,162 --> 00:00:21,730
The shop builds it into its prices.

10
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:23,902
For everyone.

11
00:00:24,202 --> 00:00:26,266
Even people who pay in cash.
